			"name": "Brawling",
			"local_notes": "Lore: A Hormagaunt closes the last few yards to a kill in a leaping bound before its scything talons go to work.\n\nDesign: DX+2 (15) for 4 points, Easy — matching the talons' own natural-weapon attack roll.",
